      "question": "काटकोन त्रिकोणात पाया = १२ सेमी व उंची = ५ सेमी असल्यास कर्णाची लांबी किती सेमी असेल? (प्रश्न क्र. 1)\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center my-3 p-3 bg-emerald-50/50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\">\n        <svg width=\"160\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 160 120\">\n            <!-- Right triangle -->\n            <polygon points=\"30,20 30,100 130,100\" fill=\"#ecfdf5\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n            <rect x=\"30\" y=\"85\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#065f46\">5 सेमी</text>\n            <text x=\"75\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#065f46\">पाया = 12 सेमी</text>\n            <text x=\"85\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">कर्ण = 13 सेमी</text>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900\">काटकोन त्रिकोण: कर्ण² = पाया² + उंची²</span>\n    </div>",
